Package: polaris-welcome
Architecture: all
Depends: python3,
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         libnotify-bin,
         pciutils,
         sudo,
         xfce4-terminal | x-terminal-emulator,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: polaris-branding, timeshift, fwupd, mokutil
Description: PolarisOS welcome app, update notifier and accessibility helper
 - polaris-welcome: first-login window to update the system, add languages,
   install the NVIDIA driver, enable Flathub, install LibreOffice, set up
   Timeshift snapshots, update firmware and open the documentation.
 - polaris-update-notifier: systemd user timer that shows a notification
   when updates are available.
 - polaris-a11y: starts the Orca screen reader when the boot option
   "screen reader" was chosen.
